Revision history for EV::Gearman

0.02    2026-07-24
        - Numerous memory-safety and wire-protocol correctness fixes from
          an adversarial code review
        - Removed shutdown_server (unsupported by gearmand >= 1.1);
          command_timeout is now per-request; minimum Perl is now 5.020

0.01    2026-06-02
        - Initial release
